  "description": "American West with Senior Western, a bold and authentic cowboy vintage font designed to bring timeless Western character to your creative projects. Featuring strong slab serifs, vintage print details, and a classic Western display style, this typeface captures the atmosphere of old saloons, cowboy signs, rodeo posters, ranch branding, and Wild West adventures.\nIts powerful letterforms make a strong visual statement while the worn authentic retro-print feel. Senior Western is perfect for creating eye-catching logos, apparel designs, posters, badges, signage, labels, packaging, merchandise, social media graphics, and branding projects that need a rugged Western personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>American West with Senior Western, a bold and authentic cowboy vintage font designed to bring timeless Western character to your creative projects. Featuring strong slab serifs, vintage print details, and a classic Western display style, this typeface captures the atmosphere of old saloons, cowboy signs, rodeo posters, ranch branding, and Wild West adventures.</p>\n<p>Its powerful letterforms make a strong visual statement while the worn authentic retro-print feel. Senior Western is perfect for creating eye-catching logos, apparel designs, posters, badges, signage, labels, packaging, merchandise, social media graphics, and branding projects that need a rugged Western personality.</p>",
